    "mcp_tool_description": "Create a local test user (a requestor, an approver, a resource admin) and assign roles in a group. The user is created with no usable password; the response's setPasswordUrl is where the admin sets one in the UI, so no password ever passes through the agent; give the admin one user's link per message. onb_status lists every user's link and passwordSet later. An existing user only receives the role assignments. onb_user_roles are role names one per line (requestor, approver, resource_admin, viewer, or a custom role). Test plan 2.3.1, 2.3.4, 2.4.1, 2.4.2. Requires a CloudBolt admin caller.",
